	abstract = {We study the completeness of the system of exponents exp(−λ n t), Re λ n > 0, in spaces L p with the power weight on the semiaxis ℝ+. We prove a sufficient condition for the completeness; one can treat it as a modification of the well-known Sz{\'a}sz condition. With p = 2 it is unimprovable (in a sense). The proof is based on the results (which are also obtained in this paper) on the distribution of zeroes of functions of the Bergman classes in a half-plane.},
